8.2 SPL / search contract (Splunk mode)
Each panel maps to a saved search with a documented field contract.

Example: risk trend (P5)

index=risk_summary earliest=$earliest$ latest=$latest$
| timechart span=1h avg(risk_score) as risk_score
| join type=left _time [
    search index=risk_anomalies earliest=$earliest$ latest=$latest$
    | timechart span=1h count as anomaly_count
]
| eval is_anomaly=if(anomaly_count>0, 1, 0)
Expected fields: _time, risk_score, is_anomaly, optional baseline_score

Example: entity × category heatmap (P6)

index=risk_entity earliest=$earliest$ latest=$latest$
| stats avg(risk_score) as value count by entity_name risk_category
Expected fields: entity_name, risk_category, value

