Demo / fallback when backend has no flags
Percent change
pctChange mode
Volatile metrics
12.2 Severity mapping
function mapSeverity(score: number, delta: number): Severity {
  if (score >= 90 || delta >= 50) return 'critical';
  if (score >= 70 || delta >= 30) return 'high';
  if (score >= 40 || delta >= 15) return 'medium';
  return 'low';
}
(Configurable via risk_policy.conf or app settings.)

